WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.960
‪ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
‪ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:48.160 --> 01:49.520
I pick you.

01:51.800 --> 01:55.880
Judging by the wounds, she was whipped.

01:56.400 --> 01:57.280
No…

01:57.960 --> 02:00.000
No!

02:02.680 --> 02:05.600
All this crying is ruining the mood.
Let me keep you company, sir.

02:12.600 --> 02:13.640
You're new here, right?

02:15.120 --> 02:16.400
Aren't you scared?

02:18.040 --> 02:19.200
What good would fear do?

02:20.600 --> 02:22.000
Survival comes first.

02:22.080 --> 02:25.360
Instead of making a scene,
I might as well find someone dependable.

02:27.000 --> 02:28.400
Interesting.

02:29.440 --> 02:33.680
Are you up for a little game?

02:33.760 --> 02:37.720
Only if you play by my rules first.

03:00.960 --> 03:02.840
What game would you like to play, sir?

03:13.200 --> 03:15.400
Your toy is certainly special.

03:16.080 --> 03:20.680
Not as special as you, pretty lady.

03:22.680 --> 03:23.720
My turn.

03:28.040 --> 03:29.680
Sure.

03:32.440 --> 03:34.320
Do you remember Hanxiao?

03:35.040 --> 03:36.120
No.

03:36.880 --> 03:38.280
Is that your name?

03:40.320 --> 03:41.360
Wrong answer.

03:41.440 --> 03:42.640
You get a punishment.

03:44.040 --> 03:44.880
No!

03:45.480 --> 03:46.440
Go away!

03:47.680 --> 03:48.520
Come on.

03:49.800 --> 03:50.680
Get back here!

04:04.200 --> 04:05.680
Where are you going?

04:12.920 --> 04:14.280
Lu Zhenglian?

04:14.360 --> 04:15.680
LU ZHENGLIAN, LEFT GRAND REMONSTRATOR

04:18.240 --> 04:20.360
Don't be petty, sir.

04:24.920 --> 04:27.120
You're quite something.

04:30.760 --> 04:32.000
There she is.

04:32.080 --> 04:33.520
Get her!

04:55.920 --> 05:00.600
XIUHONG HOUSE

05:03.320 --> 05:04.160
Something's wrong.

05:05.640 --> 05:06.920
With this qilin badge
bestowed by His Majesty,

05:07.000 --> 05:08.640
I act on his authority. Let us through.

05:09.480 --> 05:10.320
I've never heard of it.

05:10.400 --> 05:11.360
You've got some nerve.

05:22.400 --> 05:23.680
Get her!

05:38.280 --> 05:39.720
Go ahead. Run.

05:40.880 --> 05:41.800
Why aren't you running now?

05:44.240 --> 05:45.080
Does it hurt?

05:45.680 --> 05:46.520
Does it hurt?

05:48.280 --> 05:50.080
Take my eye if you want,

05:50.800 --> 05:52.760
but your life is mine to take.

06:03.520 --> 06:05.200
You're an Inner Guard.

06:06.120 --> 06:07.240
What are you doing here?

06:09.560 --> 06:10.560
Can't figure it out?

06:11.360 --> 06:12.760
Come with me
to the Palace Investigation Bureau

06:12.840 --> 06:14.000
and think it over.

06:18.600 --> 06:21.120
Tie her up with a rock and sink her.

06:24.280 --> 06:25.920
No one's ever seen this woman.

06:27.840 --> 06:30.120
But she's from the palace. Are you sure?

06:32.600 --> 06:34.120
If she lives,

06:35.400 --> 06:37.080
we'll all die.

06:37.680 --> 06:38.960
Do it right.

06:56.040 --> 06:57.920
- Who's causing trouble here?
- Sir.

07:00.720 --> 07:02.920
Sir, they're trespassing.

07:04.680 --> 07:05.640
We're from
the Palace Investigation Bureau.

07:05.720 --> 07:06.640
Oh my.

07:07.240 --> 07:08.240
My apologies.

07:08.320 --> 07:09.360
The Wannian County offices

07:09.440 --> 07:10.760
will fully cooperate
with the Inner Guards.

07:10.840 --> 07:12.160
May I see your warrant first?

07:12.240 --> 07:14.920
We tracked them all the way here.
There was no time for a warrant.

07:18.960 --> 07:20.600
Without a warrant, our hands are tied.

07:20.680 --> 07:23.320
- This is a private residence after all.
- We have no warrant,

07:23.400 --> 07:24.440
only this qilin badge.

07:24.520 --> 07:26.080
Who knows if that's even real?

07:27.000 --> 07:28.960
- You clueless fool!
- I…

07:29.040 --> 07:31.360
We ask for His Majesty's forgiveness!

07:34.560 --> 07:36.560
- Let's split up.
- All right.

07:45.400 --> 07:47.480
Didn't Jiang Tingwei tell you?

07:47.560 --> 07:49.080
I'm not just an Inner Guard.

07:49.160 --> 07:53.200
I'm also His Majesty's niece,
Princess of Fuchang County, Li Peiyi.

07:57.120 --> 07:59.240
Things went wrong. Get everyone out.

08:04.680 --> 08:05.520
Come out.

08:06.760 --> 08:08.440
There's been a situation.

08:08.520 --> 08:10.480
Gentlemen, I'm afraid
we must call it a night.

08:10.560 --> 08:12.120
- Hurry, sir.
- Be quick.

08:12.200 --> 08:13.920
- Come with me.
- You can play next time.

08:15.680 --> 08:18.080
Why not pick someone to push me in?

08:18.160 --> 08:19.560
That way, when His Majesty investigates,

08:19.640 --> 08:22.680
only one of you
will die with your whole clan.

08:26.560 --> 08:28.200
You. Do it.

08:29.360 --> 08:30.280
Me?

08:30.360 --> 08:31.800
But she's a county princess.

08:34.600 --> 08:36.640
If you won't do it, we'll kill you too!

08:40.640 --> 08:41.480
Relax.

08:42.120 --> 08:44.120
Just give me a gentle push.

08:48.480 --> 08:50.360
Hurry up. Be quick.

08:50.440 --> 08:52.280
Get all the girls out. Hurry!

08:52.360 --> 08:54.320
- Come out here! Over there!
- Come out!

08:54.400 --> 08:55.520
Hurry up. Stop dawdling!

08:55.600 --> 08:56.640
Hurry up!

08:56.720 --> 08:57.920
- Move it!
- Hurry.

08:58.000 --> 09:00.320
- Take everyone and come with me!
- Come on!

09:09.480 --> 09:11.720
Your Ladyship! Your Ladyship!

09:24.400 --> 09:25.440
Relax.

09:26.000 --> 09:27.480
Just give me a gentle push.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.440
The rest of you, come a little closer,

09:31.960 --> 09:33.960
so I can remember all your faces.

09:38.520 --> 09:40.360
If I die here,

09:40.880 --> 09:42.320
at Xiuhong House,

09:42.400 --> 09:44.440
you'll be the scapegoat they chose.

09:45.400 --> 09:46.560
But if you save me,

09:46.640 --> 09:48.160
I'll be in your debt,

09:49.400 --> 09:50.680
and I'll repay your kindness.

10:24.440 --> 10:26.120
- Any sign of her?
- No.

10:27.160 --> 10:28.000
The back courtyard!

10:28.080 --> 10:30.160
Officers, what are you looking for?

10:30.840 --> 10:32.320
Official investigation. Step aside!

10:32.840 --> 10:33.680
How dare you!

10:33.760 --> 10:36.000
How weak do you think
the Palace Investigation Bureau is?

10:36.080 --> 10:37.280
Arrest them!

10:41.400 --> 10:43.480
- Where's that crazy girl?
- The back courtyard.

11:24.120 --> 11:24.920
Boss.

11:45.080 --> 11:45.920
Who did it?

11:47.040 --> 11:49.080
It was him. He pushed Her Ladyship.

11:49.640 --> 11:51.520
- We didn't do anything.
- Let him go.

11:52.120 --> 11:54.040
Bring the rest
to the Palace Investigation Bureau.

11:54.120 --> 11:55.280
I'll question them myself.

11:57.080 --> 11:58.960
Thank you, Your Ladyship!

11:59.040 --> 12:01.520
Check for hidden passages
and secret doors.

12:01.600 --> 12:02.520
No one gets out.

12:02.600 --> 12:03.640
Understood.

12:10.720 --> 12:12.480
- To the storeroom.
- Yes.

12:14.800 --> 12:17.280
XIUHONG HOUSE

12:18.960 --> 12:20.600
- Prosecutor Gu.
- Left Street Inspector,

12:20.680 --> 12:22.360
- why are you here?
- There's been an incident.

12:26.720 --> 12:27.560
Your Ladyship!

12:28.440 --> 12:29.800
Taozhi's in the secret room
behind the south wall

12:29.880 --> 12:31.200
of the easternmost room
on the second floor.

12:43.120 --> 12:44.000
Your Ladyship,

12:44.080 --> 12:45.760
what are we looking for?

12:47.080 --> 12:48.120
It's become an embroidery room?

13:23.040 --> 13:24.560
Taozhi!

13:44.560 --> 13:45.560
Taozhi!

13:50.680 --> 13:51.560
This belongs to Taozhi.

13:51.640 --> 13:53.840
Less than two ke has passed.

13:53.920 --> 13:54.880
Where could they have gone?

13:56.520 --> 13:57.520
LONGXIANG NOODLES

14:02.720 --> 14:03.760
The carriage.

14:04.280 --> 14:06.200
The ward gates are closed now.
They can't have left Daozheng Ward.

14:06.280 --> 14:08.120
Those men aren't ordinary people.

14:08.200 --> 14:09.720
With all the residences
and taverns in the ward,

14:09.800 --> 14:10.760
they won't be easy to find.

14:11.280 --> 14:13.200
Mr. Gu, where did you see
the carriage? Show me.

14:13.280 --> 14:14.360
Come with me.

14:18.960 --> 14:20.480
Your Ladyship, we've only caught
a few workers and guards.

14:20.560 --> 14:21.400
No sign of the others.

14:24.080 --> 14:26.000
Tell Zhang Boyan
to search with Prosecutor Gu.

14:26.080 --> 14:28.840
Look for a man with an injured left eye
and a few young girls.

14:28.920 --> 14:31.600
They should be easy to spot,
unless someone is helping them.

14:31.680 --> 14:33.240
But come dawn when the ward gates
open, they can be gone.

14:33.320 --> 14:34.880
- Hurry.
- Understood.

14:45.000 --> 14:48.600
"Birds die for food and people for money."

14:50.200 --> 14:53.920
Is this bit of money really worth
your life?

14:56.440 --> 14:57.560
Take the money.

14:57.640 --> 14:59.440
Just pretend you never saw me, all right?

15:03.840 --> 15:05.840
What kind of business do you run?

15:06.360 --> 15:07.360
It must've been quite profitable.

15:10.640 --> 15:13.800
Please, have mercy and let me go.

15:14.480 --> 15:15.320
All right.

15:16.280 --> 15:19.120
I'll let you go.

15:20.520 --> 15:21.600
Thank you, sir.

15:25.680 --> 15:26.960
Sorry,

15:27.480 --> 15:30.040
I forgot I had an assistant with me.

15:31.240 --> 15:34.280
Is there anything else
valuable in that bundle?

15:34.360 --> 15:36.680
I already gave you all my money.

15:36.760 --> 15:39.480
Sorry, but you'll need to come with me.

15:42.080 --> 15:42.920
Move.

15:49.600 --> 15:51.480
- Hand it over.
- What?

15:53.360 --> 15:54.240
Evidence.

15:55.200 --> 15:56.040
Wait.

15:59.680 --> 16:01.040
LONGXIANG NOODLES

16:01.120 --> 16:03.240
This is where I saw that carriage.

16:04.160 --> 16:06.320
It took everyone away?

16:06.400 --> 16:08.000
It was a large carriage
drawn by two horses,

16:08.080 --> 16:09.440
wider than most by at least two chi.

16:09.520 --> 16:11.400
They were in a hurry.

16:11.480 --> 16:12.400
They must've squeezed everyone in.

16:13.840 --> 16:14.920
Makes sense.

16:26.440 --> 16:27.560
Come on.

16:29.920 --> 16:30.840
Where are they?

16:31.360 --> 16:32.800
I'm new here.

16:32.880 --> 16:34.800
I just do odd jobs.

16:34.880 --> 16:37.040
I have no idea what you're talking about.

16:39.440 --> 16:41.080
Didn't Your Ladyship come by before?

16:41.160 --> 16:43.600
No orders were placed these last two days.

16:43.680 --> 16:45.160
Who exactly are you looking for?

16:46.840 --> 16:47.680
Think carefully.

16:48.200 --> 16:52.440
They tried to drown me.
I can have you executed at any time.

16:54.120 --> 16:56.200
The workers didn't know who you were.

16:56.280 --> 16:58.080
They thought you were a thief breaking in.

16:58.720 --> 17:00.880
But they do deserve
punishment for lynching.

17:00.960 --> 17:04.119
I failed in my supervision.
I'll accept any punishment.

17:07.839 --> 17:09.520
You're quite the stewardess,

17:10.960 --> 17:13.319
eloquent and quick-witted.

17:13.400 --> 17:14.359
With just a few words,

17:14.440 --> 17:16.440
you've made all your faults
sound like mere poor supervision.

17:16.520 --> 17:17.359
No matter.

17:18.000 --> 17:20.200
I've seen your tricks.

17:20.280 --> 17:21.960
You'll see mine

17:22.040 --> 17:23.960
when you get
to the Palace Investigation Bureau.

17:24.960 --> 17:27.200
I truly don't know
what Your Ladyship is talking about.

17:27.280 --> 17:29.000
Where is Jiang Tingwei?

17:29.080 --> 17:30.920
He's Mr. Sun's bodyguard.

17:31.480 --> 17:33.640
You should ask Mr. Sun.

17:35.640 --> 17:36.640
Fine.

17:36.720 --> 17:39.200
FENG'S GROCERY

17:44.160 --> 17:46.480
From here,
the carriage tracks are shallower.

17:46.560 --> 17:47.560
Someone got off.

17:47.640 --> 17:49.600
There should be eight women
under their control.

17:49.680 --> 17:52.280
No way they'd let them
be seen out on the street.

17:52.920 --> 17:53.920
The ones who got off here

17:54.000 --> 17:55.600
must be the men Her Ladyship saw.

17:55.680 --> 17:58.440
Where would they take my sister?

17:58.520 --> 18:01.160
Mr. Gu, don't let worry
cloud your judgment.

18:01.240 --> 18:02.520
The ward gates are closed.

18:02.600 --> 18:03.600
They must be hiding

18:03.680 --> 18:05.440
somewhere in the ward
that draws no attention.

18:06.120 --> 18:08.680
On the west side of Daozheng Ward
are mostly taverns and brothels.

18:08.760 --> 18:09.960
Residences are mostly on the east.

18:10.480 --> 18:13.440
Judging by the tracks, they went south.

18:13.520 --> 18:15.960
What if they're just circling around?

18:16.040 --> 18:17.800
That man's got an injured eye.

18:17.880 --> 18:21.000
I doubt he's in the mood
for tricks. Go ahead.

18:22.120 --> 18:22.960
Let's go.

18:31.200 --> 18:33.720
XIUHONG HOUSE

18:38.120 --> 18:40.040
Care for some wine to warm yourself up?

18:40.640 --> 18:42.680
I can't hold my liquor.
I'd better not drink.

18:43.960 --> 18:46.320
Reliable as ever.

18:47.680 --> 18:49.800
I'm not familiar with officials
from the old dynasty.

18:49.880 --> 18:51.120
What should we do next?

18:51.800 --> 18:54.920
I've been told the female musician
Remonstrator Lu favors

18:55.000 --> 18:56.360
is at Swallow House.

18:57.920 --> 18:59.280
Mr. Xiao, let's pay it a visit.

18:59.880 --> 19:00.800
All right.

19:04.880 --> 19:07.200
These old bones need rest.
I'm heading back.

19:08.000 --> 19:09.600
I'll take those people back to the bureau.

19:14.160 --> 19:15.000
Let's go.

19:17.200 --> 19:18.800
Mr. Xiao, did we ever meet before?

19:22.560 --> 19:23.920
Has Your Ladyship forgotten?

19:24.000 --> 19:26.600
As an Astronomical Bureau official,
I rarely enter the palace.

19:29.360 --> 19:31.200
So, did you ever

19:32.680 --> 19:33.600
meet me before?

19:39.560 --> 19:40.520
I don't remember.

19:55.560 --> 19:59.280
SWALLOW HOUSE

19:59.880 --> 20:00.720
You…

20:04.240 --> 20:05.080
Easy…

20:07.480 --> 20:10.920
This is Master Lu's private room.
Have you come to the wrong place, sir?

20:11.000 --> 20:12.720
The night is lovely.

20:12.800 --> 20:16.200
Remonstrator Lu, you seem
to be enjoying it to the fullest.

20:16.720 --> 20:17.680
Who are you?

20:17.760 --> 20:18.840
Someone wishes to see you.

20:24.200 --> 20:26.440
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU

20:28.680 --> 20:31.480
Who came up with this alibi
for you, Remonstrator Lu?

20:32.960 --> 20:34.600
I'm afraid I don't follow, Your Ladyship.

20:35.480 --> 20:37.840
I went to Swallow House
at half past the You hour

20:37.920 --> 20:39.280
and stayed in my private room
the whole night.

20:39.360 --> 20:40.720
That's odd.

20:41.240 --> 20:44.640
At half past the You hour,
I saw you at Xiuhong House.

20:44.720 --> 20:46.240
Impossible.

20:48.400 --> 20:50.320
I was at Swallow House the entire time,

20:50.400 --> 20:52.600
listening to music and admiring
the moon with Liu Ying'er.

20:52.680 --> 20:54.360
If I'm not mistaken,

20:54.440 --> 20:56.160
you entered through the back door.

20:56.240 --> 20:57.680
Only Liu Ying'er saw you, right?

20:59.440 --> 21:00.400
So what?

21:01.480 --> 21:05.240
That means, apart from her,
no one else can vouch for your story.

21:05.320 --> 21:06.840
Quite the opposite.

21:07.360 --> 21:10.280
Everyone at Swallow House
can vouch for me.

21:10.920 --> 21:13.040
Liu Ying'er played a lovely piece,

21:13.120 --> 21:17.320
but I thought the ending was a bit trite

21:17.400 --> 21:18.840
and made some harsh comments.

21:18.920 --> 21:21.320
She got upset, stood up, and walked away.

21:21.400 --> 21:22.840
When I chased after her, I lost my footing

21:22.920 --> 21:24.680
and tumbled down the stairs.

21:24.760 --> 21:27.040
It caused a commotion.

21:27.120 --> 21:29.240
A lot of people at Swallow House saw it.

21:29.320 --> 21:31.200
When did you fall?

21:31.720 --> 21:33.400
If it was after
the fifth ke into the Xu hour,

21:33.480 --> 21:36.280
even if the whole Western Capital
saw you at Swallow House,

21:36.360 --> 21:37.200
it means nothing.

21:37.280 --> 21:40.040
Feel free to check, Your Ladyship.

21:40.560 --> 21:43.120
I'm getting old. I can't remember clearly.

21:55.600 --> 21:57.680
Your Ladyship, Consort Shu has arrived.

21:59.680 --> 22:00.840
I didn't tell her anything.

22:11.520 --> 22:13.600
Why is Your Highness
here so late at night?

22:14.360 --> 22:15.840
Still risking your life
for an investigation, I see.

22:16.600 --> 22:19.560
Eat this chicken soup before it gets cold.

22:19.640 --> 22:20.880
You need to warm up.

22:24.600 --> 22:28.800
This time, His Majesty
must reward Mr. Xiao properly.

22:28.880 --> 22:30.920
It's the second time he's saved you.

22:33.480 --> 22:36.960
Remember when you first entered the palace
and accidentally fell into the water?

22:37.600 --> 22:39.120
He was the one who saved you.

22:39.720 --> 22:41.880
Xiao Wenyuan brought him to the palace
for an audience with His Majesty.

22:42.480 --> 22:44.680
His first time in the palace,
he got curious

22:45.280 --> 22:47.000
and wandered to the Moonlit Pond,

22:47.600 --> 22:49.160
where he happened to see you fall in.

22:49.240 --> 22:50.240
He saved you.

23:28.560 --> 23:29.640
He saved me?

23:30.520 --> 23:31.960
Why has no one ever mentioned it?

23:32.760 --> 23:35.000
His Majesty wanted
to grant him a great reward,

23:35.080 --> 23:38.040
but Grand Tutor Xiao said

23:38.560 --> 23:40.520
that with Huaijin about to join
the Astronomical Bureau,

23:40.600 --> 23:41.640
being away from court affairs,

23:41.720 --> 23:44.480
a great reward
would only invite suspicion.

23:44.560 --> 23:46.840
He begged His Majesty to keep it quiet.

24:48.680 --> 24:51.360
Your Ladyship, I can't draw
with you staring at me like this.

24:52.040 --> 24:53.320
I just heard

24:53.920 --> 24:56.200
that when you were a boy,

24:56.280 --> 24:58.280
you saved someone from the Moonlit Pond.

25:02.120 --> 25:04.880
Now that you mention it, I suppose I did.

25:05.640 --> 25:07.240
You never spoke of it.

25:09.240 --> 25:10.560
It's nothing to brag about.

25:10.640 --> 25:12.000
Yes, I saved someone,

25:12.080 --> 25:12.960
but I also got caught

25:13.040 --> 25:14.520
sneaking into a palace courtyard
without permission.

25:15.040 --> 25:17.160
I got a severe scolding and was grounded.

25:20.240 --> 25:22.640
Don't you want to know who you saved?

25:26.760 --> 25:29.480
The person I saved
wasn't Your Ladyship, was it?

25:30.960 --> 25:31.800
That's right.

25:31.880 --> 25:33.720
You saved my life, Mr. Xiao.

25:35.000 --> 25:35.840
Really?

25:38.240 --> 25:40.440
You rescued me
right after I fell into the water.

25:40.520 --> 25:42.720
Did you see anyone else
nearby at the time?

25:46.080 --> 25:47.280
Wasn't it an accident that you fell in?

25:48.720 --> 25:51.160
I'm just curious as to where
my maids were when I fell.

25:52.400 --> 25:53.800
There couldn't have been
anyone else around,

25:53.880 --> 25:55.320
or I wouldn't have needed to rescue you.

26:04.840 --> 26:06.280
Why are you leaning
so close, Your Ladyship?

26:07.680 --> 26:09.080
I'm thinking about
how to repay your kindness.

26:12.160 --> 26:13.000
No need for that.

26:20.440 --> 26:21.280
Your Ladyship,

26:21.800 --> 26:24.240
Remonstrator Lu flat-out denies
going to Xiuhong House yesterday.

26:24.320 --> 26:26.400
Zhenniang and the workers
aren't talking either.

26:27.640 --> 26:29.160
I see. You may go.

26:30.000 --> 26:30.840
Yes.

26:34.600 --> 26:36.480
In less than two ke,

26:37.000 --> 26:38.960
they turned the storeroom
back to the way it was

26:39.040 --> 26:41.360
and got everyone out of Xiuhong House.

26:41.960 --> 26:43.200
They really are well-trained.

26:44.200 --> 26:45.040
It's actually not that hard.

26:46.040 --> 26:48.320
There were lamp grooves
built into all four walls,

26:48.400 --> 26:50.360
but only three walls had grooves
blackened from use.

26:50.960 --> 26:54.120
The innermost grooves
showed no signs of ever being used.

26:54.200 --> 26:55.480
They never lit the lamps on that wall.

26:56.000 --> 26:57.880
And while the floor was spotless,

26:57.960 --> 26:59.760
there was a patch of dust
about four cun square

26:59.840 --> 27:00.760
at the very back.

27:00.840 --> 27:04.040
They must've stacked the looms
and sundries against that wall,

27:04.120 --> 27:05.240
used a screen to hide them,

27:05.320 --> 27:07.360
and rearranged the rest
of the room as needed.

27:07.440 --> 27:08.760
If something unexpected happened…

27:12.080 --> 27:14.520
There seemed to be plenty of items,
but they were all light.

27:14.600 --> 27:17.320
Even the banquet tables and stools
could be mixed in.

27:17.400 --> 27:19.080
Just a few people could reset
the room very quickly.

27:19.160 --> 27:21.360
Xiuhong House is well-located
and has plenty of side doors.

27:21.440 --> 27:24.640
The people likely slipped away
while we were arguing with the guards.

27:24.720 --> 27:25.560
Strange.

27:25.640 --> 27:27.560
Lu Zhenglian really
did fall down the stairs

27:27.640 --> 27:28.720
at the second ke of the Xu hour.

27:28.800 --> 27:30.320
Many at Swallow House saw it.

27:30.920 --> 27:33.760
But he was whipping me
at Xiuhong House at that same time.

27:33.840 --> 27:34.960
Does he have a double or something?

27:35.720 --> 27:37.760
The staff at Swallow House
might have covered for him,

27:37.840 --> 27:39.840
but I questioned
all the guests individually.

27:39.920 --> 27:40.760
They couldn't all be lying.

27:43.320 --> 27:44.680
Is there anything special

27:45.200 --> 27:47.920
- about the second ke of the Xu hour?
- No.

27:48.000 --> 27:50.320
Then why do they all
remember that exact time?

27:51.080 --> 27:51.920
I'll go ask again.

27:52.520 --> 27:53.360
Wait.

27:54.480 --> 27:56.360
The ward gates are open now. Post this up.

27:56.440 --> 27:58.280
It'll help Mr. Gu find them faster.

28:04.560 --> 28:06.400
- What's this?
- A sketch of Jiang Tingwei.

28:11.200 --> 28:14.120
I'll get an artist to make more copies,

28:14.200 --> 28:16.160
so we can post them around Daozheng Ward.

28:16.800 --> 28:18.440
How many do you need? I can draw them.

28:20.880 --> 28:22.680
I need you to come with me
to Swallow House.

28:23.360 --> 28:26.080
Leave the sketches to the artist.

28:38.240 --> 28:40.120
MAP OF DAOZHENG WARD

28:41.880 --> 28:45.600
Prosecutor Gu, I found Zhenniang
at a villa in Daozheng Ward.

28:45.680 --> 28:46.480
Let's go.

29:00.880 --> 29:01.720
It's still warm.

29:02.800 --> 29:03.760
They can't have gone far.

29:04.840 --> 29:06.040
After them!

29:08.160 --> 29:10.200
Your Ladyship, you should hurry
to the front hall. Something's happened.

29:10.280 --> 29:12.600
Let the old man deal with it.
I'm heading to Swallow House.

29:12.680 --> 29:14.120
Inspector Du can't handle it alone.

29:14.640 --> 29:15.680
He came for you.

29:25.120 --> 29:27.480
- Sir.
- Any sign of suspicious people?

29:27.560 --> 29:29.120
Other than earlier this morning,

29:29.200 --> 29:30.760
not many people came or went today.

29:30.840 --> 29:32.720
We checked everyone,
but no one matched the sketch.

29:41.800 --> 29:43.040
Sir.

29:43.120 --> 29:44.040
Where did this come from?

29:44.120 --> 29:46.800
An hour ago, a wedding carriage went out.

29:46.880 --> 29:48.640
Their maid gave these to us.

29:51.920 --> 29:53.320
Who else was in that group?

29:54.440 --> 29:57.040
There was one coachman,
four or five maids,

29:57.120 --> 29:58.440
and two or three dowry attendants.

29:58.520 --> 30:00.320
The bride was in the carriage.

30:00.400 --> 30:03.040
That's right. One of the ladies
gave us the pastries.

30:05.400 --> 30:07.000
We're escorting a bride.

30:12.560 --> 30:13.400
Escorting a bride?

30:36.120 --> 30:36.960
Go ahead.

30:39.960 --> 30:42.720
Set up checkpoints at all city gates.
Spread the sketch around.

30:42.800 --> 30:43.640
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

30:56.360 --> 30:58.640
What brings you here, Eunuch Guo?

31:00.080 --> 31:01.040
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

31:01.120 --> 31:03.520
Forgive my bluntness.

31:03.600 --> 31:06.000
Is Left Grand Remonstrator
Lu Zhenglian being held

31:06.080 --> 31:07.560
at the Palace Investigation Bureau?

31:11.000 --> 31:13.040
Lu Zhenglian must really carry weight

31:13.120 --> 31:15.160
for you to come all this way in person
just to get him out.

31:16.280 --> 31:18.200
I didn't come of my own accord,
Your Ladyship.

31:18.280 --> 31:19.440
His Majesty sent me.

31:19.520 --> 31:22.840
This morning, His Majesty
summoned Remonstrator Lu to court,

31:22.920 --> 31:24.760
but he never showed up.

31:24.840 --> 31:26.520
His Majesty was furious.

31:27.120 --> 31:28.280
Only later did he learn

31:28.800 --> 31:30.280
Remonstrator Lu was being detained
by Your Ladyship

31:30.360 --> 31:32.040
with no charges filed.

31:33.240 --> 31:34.320
His Majesty wants him released,

31:34.400 --> 31:36.240
but the Palace Investigation Bureau
won't let him go.

31:36.320 --> 31:38.800
So I had no choice but to come ask
for an explanation.

31:39.640 --> 31:41.560
Xiuhong House was running
a brothel in secret,

31:41.640 --> 31:43.520
imprisoning former palace maids
and forcing them to serve guests.

31:43.600 --> 31:45.120
Remonstrator Lu was there last night.

31:45.200 --> 31:47.440
I can't release him.

31:48.680 --> 31:50.040
But has he been convicted?

31:51.840 --> 31:53.880
Are you here to supervise
my investigation, Eunuch Guo?

31:53.960 --> 31:55.760
No, I wouldn't dare.

31:55.840 --> 31:57.320
It's just…

31:57.400 --> 31:59.920
If someone wants to bring this matter
before His Majesty,

32:00.000 --> 32:01.120
then I'll make a trip with you.

32:13.320 --> 32:14.560
Greetings from Li Peiyi to Your Majesty.

32:31.280 --> 32:33.000
Your Majesty, please hear me out.

32:36.200 --> 32:37.560
Last night at Xiuhong House,

32:37.640 --> 32:40.040
I saw with my own eyes a secret brothel

32:40.120 --> 32:41.560
where former palace maids
were forced into prostitution.

32:41.640 --> 32:43.560
Hanxiao, the victim
of the "Flower on the Wall" case,

32:43.640 --> 32:45.520
was likely imprisoned there as well.

32:45.600 --> 32:48.200
I saw and heard it clearly.

32:48.280 --> 32:49.880
Remonstrator Lu was present.

32:49.960 --> 32:51.880
But I just can't find evidence
to convict him.

32:51.960 --> 32:54.440
Your Majesty, this is truly unfair!

32:54.520 --> 32:55.960
How dare you even say that?

32:56.040 --> 32:58.320
You disguised yourself as a courtesan
and went to such a filthy place.

32:58.400 --> 33:00.680
Do you care nothing
for your own reputation

33:00.760 --> 33:03.000
or for the royal family's dignity?

33:03.080 --> 33:07.000
So, Your Majesty believes
I haven't wronged Lu Zhenglian?

33:09.040 --> 33:10.640
If Xiuhong House
has truly imprisoned palace maids

33:11.160 --> 33:13.160
and run a secret brothel

33:13.240 --> 33:15.440
serving the powerful,
they will be severely punished.

33:15.520 --> 33:19.400
But you can't detain
a fourth-rank minister on your word alone.

33:19.480 --> 33:21.800
- I'm searching for evidence.
- Then he isn't guilty for now.

33:22.520 --> 33:23.880
Is Your Majesty shielding him?

33:26.720 --> 33:27.920
What is
the Palace Investigation Bureau for, then?

33:28.000 --> 33:29.480
What use are laws and regulations?

33:29.560 --> 33:32.440
Your Majesty's attitude
is what truly damages royal dignity.

33:33.600 --> 33:36.480
How bold you are! And you tried to dodge?

33:41.280 --> 33:43.800
See for yourself.
After the commotion you caused last night,

33:43.880 --> 33:47.160
how many memorials
have landed on my desk this morning?

33:58.400 --> 34:00.000
I'm investigating
in accordance with the law.

34:00.080 --> 34:00.920
I'm not afraid of their petitions.

34:01.000 --> 34:02.840
The petitions aren't about you.

34:02.920 --> 34:04.440
They're about Lu Zhenglian,

34:04.520 --> 34:08.120
accusing him of neglecting his duties.

34:10.159 --> 34:13.639
They want Your Majesty to intervene,
to let you know

34:13.719 --> 34:15.320
I'm holding Lu Zhenglian
at the Palace Investigation Bureau?

34:15.400 --> 34:16.480
Do you know why they dared

34:16.560 --> 34:18.840
to join forces and submit
all these memorials?

34:19.440 --> 34:21.639
Don't you think they know I favor you?

34:21.719 --> 34:24.239
Don't you think they expected
you'd come here to tell me all this?

34:24.920 --> 34:26.080
They dare threaten even Your Majesty?

34:26.159 --> 34:27.239
This isn't a threat.

34:27.320 --> 34:29.360
If there had been evidence, it would be.

34:29.440 --> 34:31.920
But without evidence,
they're simply making a plea,

34:32.000 --> 34:33.040
asking for justice
for a fourth-rank minister

34:33.120 --> 34:34.520
they believe
has been wrongfully imprisoned.

34:37.639 --> 34:39.239
They really are cunning.

34:40.239 --> 34:41.560
I was too careless.

34:41.639 --> 34:45.239
For now, Lu Zhenglian's only wrongdoing
is drinking and staying at Swallow House

34:45.320 --> 34:46.600
on a workday.

34:46.679 --> 34:47.520
I'll release him right away.

34:47.600 --> 34:48.600
You're still going to investigate?

34:49.520 --> 34:50.360
Of course.

34:50.880 --> 34:53.080
Only by finding evidence
and convicting Lu Zhenglian

34:53.159 --> 34:54.320
can I make things right for Your Majesty.

34:54.400 --> 34:56.360
What do you mean,
"make things right" for me?

34:56.440 --> 34:57.280
I misspoke.

34:57.880 --> 34:59.680
Only then can I bring justice
for the palace maids

34:59.760 --> 35:01.000
and restore the royal family's honor.

35:02.440 --> 35:03.640
Enough. Get out!

35:12.880 --> 35:13.920
How did it go?

35:15.320 --> 35:16.480
Release Lu Zhenglian.

35:19.520 --> 35:22.680
I'm afraid someone's
already come to collect him.

35:23.680 --> 35:25.680
It's getting late. We need
to head to Swallow House now.

35:25.760 --> 35:27.920
Your Ladyship, your arm needs tending,

35:28.000 --> 35:29.280
or the wound could get infected
and leave a scar.

35:29.360 --> 35:30.960
That's what I want.

35:34.400 --> 35:37.200
Does this remind you of Hanxiao's scars?

35:38.280 --> 35:40.080
Was Hanxiao abused
by Lu Zhenglian before she died?

35:41.160 --> 35:43.080
We'll know once it scars.

35:43.160 --> 35:45.720
They want evidence,
so I'll find it for them.

35:50.720 --> 35:53.880
Mr. Xiao, you were right.

35:53.960 --> 35:57.360
She's a lot like me, only crazier.

35:58.240 --> 36:01.600
She doesn't care about her own well-being

36:01.680 --> 36:03.440
or life.

36:03.520 --> 36:06.400
She'll risk anything to solve a case.

36:07.560 --> 36:10.360
I've been watching over her
all these years.

36:11.000 --> 36:12.440
She's gotten into plenty of minor trouble,

36:13.120 --> 36:14.240
but at least

36:14.320 --> 36:17.440
she's made it this far in one piece.

36:18.520 --> 36:19.800
Mr. Xiao,

36:23.600 --> 36:24.800
I'm getting old.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.480
It's time I retired.

36:26.560 --> 36:28.960
I've put in my request.

36:29.040 --> 36:32.680
Once it's approved,
I'll be leaving the palace.

36:34.000 --> 36:37.240
I used to worry about her

36:37.960 --> 36:40.280
getting into trouble without me around.

36:40.360 --> 36:41.880
But now,

36:42.640 --> 36:44.080
I think she'll be fine.

36:45.360 --> 36:48.280
- Thank you for everything.
- Inspector Du,

36:48.880 --> 36:50.480
I don't quite follow.

36:51.320 --> 36:52.280
No need to say more.

36:52.880 --> 36:54.000
You're a smart man.

36:54.080 --> 36:57.320
If I go on, it'll sound
like a deathbed entrustment.

36:57.400 --> 37:00.120
I don't want to jinx myself.

37:00.200 --> 37:01.120
Deathbed entrustment?

37:04.160 --> 37:06.080
Shouldn't you go after her?

37:06.160 --> 37:07.920
She's nearly out of the palace now.

37:14.840 --> 37:17.960
SWALLOW HOUSE

37:22.760 --> 37:24.240
ROUGE AND LAUGHTER - SILK AND SONG

37:25.480 --> 37:26.680
Excuse me. Coming through.

37:29.640 --> 37:31.480
Here's your tea.

37:31.560 --> 37:33.880
There was quite
a commotion here last night.

37:34.760 --> 37:36.080
First time for us, too.

37:36.160 --> 37:38.480
The boss was furious.

37:38.560 --> 37:41.280
The worker involved was fired before dawn.

37:41.360 --> 37:43.720
Remonstrator Lu fell down the stairs.

37:43.800 --> 37:44.920
Why fire a worker?

37:46.160 --> 37:47.920
Enjoy your tea.

37:48.000 --> 37:48.880
Wait.

37:51.560 --> 37:53.480
- What is this?
- Money for your story.

37:53.560 --> 37:54.400
Will you tell me?

38:00.840 --> 38:03.560
Here we have a prize called
"Hundred Birds Return to Nest."

38:03.640 --> 38:05.360
It's the most expensive in the house,

38:05.440 --> 38:06.960
worth 50 liang of gold.

38:07.640 --> 38:08.960
That much?

38:12.920 --> 38:15.440
On the third day of the fifth month,
at the second ke of the Xu hour,

38:15.520 --> 38:19.360
Mr. Lu presents Miss Miao
with Swallow House's top prize,

38:19.440 --> 38:21.680
"Hundred Birds Return to Nest"!

38:21.760 --> 38:22.760
- Nice!
- Wonderful!

38:23.360 --> 38:24.040
Announce it to the whole house.

38:24.120 --> 38:24.960
- Yes.
- Hurry, go.

38:26.480 --> 38:28.280
- The boss had us
- On the third day of the fifth month,

38:28.360 --> 38:29.880
- go around the whole house, calling out,
- at the second ke of the Xu hour…

38:29.960 --> 38:32.040
"On the third day of the fifth month,
at the second ke of the Xu hour,

38:32.120 --> 38:35.280
Mr. Lu presents Miss Miao
with Swallow House's top prize,

38:35.360 --> 38:36.480
'Hundred Birds Return to Nest!'"

38:37.560 --> 38:39.560
Please welcome Mr. Lu!

38:42.000 --> 38:43.200
Where is he?

38:43.280 --> 38:44.480
Where is Mr. Lu?

38:44.560 --> 38:47.240
But Mr. Lu never showed up.

38:47.320 --> 38:48.600
Instead, Remonstrator Lu did.

38:49.720 --> 38:51.240
Ying'er! Ying'er!

38:51.320 --> 38:52.920
Let me explain. Slow down!

38:53.000 --> 38:54.040
Ying'er,

38:54.120 --> 38:55.200
slow down.

38:55.280 --> 38:57.120
Move aside! Ying'er!

38:57.200 --> 38:58.600
Let me explain, Ying'er.

38:59.360 --> 39:01.040
- Ying'er, hear me out.
- Leave me alone!

39:06.440 --> 39:09.480
- Master Lu!
- Remonstrator Lu's tumble

39:09.560 --> 39:10.720
made quite a scene,

39:10.800 --> 39:12.680
and everyone soon forgot about Mr. Lu.

39:13.680 --> 39:14.520
Master Lu,

39:15.240 --> 39:16.480
are you all right?

39:17.160 --> 39:18.640
Mr. Lu spent a fortune,

39:18.720 --> 39:20.320
but Remonstrator Lu stole the spotlight,

39:20.400 --> 39:24.040
showing up at Swallow House on a workday.

39:24.120 --> 39:25.840
What was meant to be a joyful event

39:25.920 --> 39:27.480
ended up as a laughingstock
across Daozheng Ward.

39:27.560 --> 39:30.000
So our boss told us
never to mention it again.

39:30.080 --> 39:33.240
Is Mr. Lu a regular here?

39:33.320 --> 39:35.080
No, he was new.

39:35.160 --> 39:37.440
It was his first time here,
and he spent lavishly.

39:37.520 --> 39:40.240
But I doubt he'll ever be back.

39:42.480 --> 39:44.480
He won't be coming back.

39:44.560 --> 39:46.280
In fact, I doubt this Mr. Lu even exists.

39:47.920 --> 39:49.200
Do you keep a water clock here?

39:50.040 --> 39:52.560
Ordinary businesses
can't afford a water clock.

39:52.640 --> 39:55.920
Then how did your boss know
the time so precisely?

39:56.000 --> 39:58.400
One of the staff
probably asked the night watchman

39:58.480 --> 40:00.440
and reported it to the boss.

40:00.520 --> 40:02.160
Enjoy your tea.

40:06.800 --> 40:07.960
SWALLOW HOUSE

40:08.040 --> 40:09.280
I've told you everything.

40:09.360 --> 40:12.840
Remonstrator Lu stayed in his private room
until he was taken away.

40:12.920 --> 40:14.320
That's the truth.

40:14.840 --> 40:16.160
Even before His Majesty,

40:16.760 --> 40:18.240
I'd say the same thing.

40:20.520 --> 40:21.880
That's not what we're here to ask.

40:21.960 --> 40:23.880
Last night, you and Remonstrator Lu

40:23.960 --> 40:26.680
played music, admired the moon,
and composed poems.

40:26.760 --> 40:28.160
The moonlight must have been beautiful.

40:29.360 --> 40:30.200
It was.

40:31.000 --> 40:33.240
The crescent moon
hung above the willow branches.

40:33.960 --> 40:36.120
Master Lu even wrote lyrics for a piece,

40:36.720 --> 40:38.560
"Mist shrouds a silver boat.

40:38.640 --> 40:39.920
The moonlight crowns the flowers.

40:40.000 --> 40:41.480
The heart is drawn

40:43.120 --> 40:44.000
to the beauty."

40:44.880 --> 40:48.760
Did he write these lyrics before he fell?

40:49.560 --> 40:50.440
Yes.

40:50.960 --> 40:53.920
After his fall,
he stayed on the couch to rest

40:54.000 --> 40:57.400
until you arrived.

40:58.480 --> 40:59.600
Have you noticed something?

41:00.200 --> 41:02.120
I need to return
to the Astronomical Bureau to confirm it.

41:15.240 --> 41:16.560
Who's there?

41:18.200 --> 41:20.960
Remonstrator Lu, I've found
the evidence as you demanded.

41:21.040 --> 41:22.600
Come with me once more.
